# General Ignore Patterns
*~
.DS_Store
*.*ca-bundle
__pycache__

# These files are computer specific and change too frequently to store in a VCS
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
**/User/Projects/recent.json
**/User/CodeMap/Code - Map

# Prettier Cache
node_modules/.cache/prettier/.prettier-caches

# Override Global Ignore
!CLAUDE.local.md
